Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:03.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的能打败她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他不是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that's not Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cat's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路西法 - 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucifer. - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久以来 掌舵之人懦弱低能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have had a coward and a fool at the helm for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是你的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是把你从狗舍里放出来太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I let you out of that kettle too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小脑瓜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What treasonous thoughts do you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,琢磨什么叛逆的念头呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}brewing in that little head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得你能打败阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you thought you could beat Amara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会主动去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be taking the fight to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在或许有些准备不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be a bit under-equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道纳粹有个专门进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know the Nazis had a special branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古的分支吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}devoted to archaeology?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, mon amour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面提到了一件超能武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they speak of a super weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「上帝之手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Hand of God."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但同作为记录者我跟你说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Man of Letters to Man of Letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在未来打一场仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fighting a war in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的战争不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like your war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争很大 像圣经 我需要你的武器获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big, Biblical, and I need your weapon to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和阿玛拉有联系的是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's the one with the link to Amara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}why have I been trying to spare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没能量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想到上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd have thought the hand of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能打一炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}would turn out to be a one-hitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场比赛非常激烈 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a barn burner, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩纷呈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抱了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picks him up and…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,背部击碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a back breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:07.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密苏里州 布里姆森）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只数了两个数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but only a two count.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,新手肖恩·哈利没能击败「绞刑人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rookie, Shawn Harley, fails to take "The hangman" down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子遭到重击\N{\fnArial\fs30}A stinger to the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还醉着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously drunk right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.53,0:01:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,背部又遭一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, and it's a stinger to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被打到场边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes him to the turnbuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道接下来会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and we know what's coming next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吊死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hang his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over now, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,输家被吊起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lift-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利呼吸困难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Harley struggling to breathe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脸色发青了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's turning blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见我的绳子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, has anyone seen my rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 我刚刚差点没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? I almost died out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harley, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要站在这酒鬼这边吗 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take the wino's side? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些老家伙总是抱团 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You old-timers like to stick together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do us a favor…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep a leash on your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他可能要受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen the, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,包怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得最强摔跤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Top Notch wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候爸爸带我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those, uh, wrestling shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看过的摔跤比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad took us to when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚看到一则讣告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came across an obituary last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「绞刑人」拉瑞·李死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry "The hangman" Lee died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不是… - 爸爸最喜欢的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wasn't he, uh… - He was dad's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次绞索悬下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time that noose would come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸都会站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad would be up on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很少能看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was one of the few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么开心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ever saw him actually happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 葬礼距这里不到一天的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the, uh, funeral's less than a day's drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去悼念一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go pay our respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们现在有点忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think o-our plates are a little full?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面情况很糟啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's bad out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 萨姆 你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sam. You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这一周完全沉浸在查传说里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done nothing but mainline lore for a week, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没查到任何其他上帝之手或是阿玛拉的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got jack on another hand of God and Amara,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救小卡的办法更是没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've got even less jack on how to save Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想被我们救的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他自己还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if he doesn't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - I'm burnt, man. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我们需要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need… we need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去伸伸腿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go stretch our legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.57,0:04:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 ABC\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, a-b-c…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一定要成功」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Always be closing."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们越早给我找到另一个上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner you little storm clouds find me another hand of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就越开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}the happier I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我开心的 是吧 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to be happy, don't you, dollface?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,答得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:05:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天入地 东奔西跑 到处找\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna look high, look low, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜遍每个仓库 每户农舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search every warehouse, every farmhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,母鸡舍 屋外厕所 狗舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}every henhouse, outhouse, and doghouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 小狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, little puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么要补充的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something to add?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我肯定会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would tell you. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以继续干活儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I return to my task?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要改一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one minor tweak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「尖叫」卡西·莱昂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "The scream" Casey Lyons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「破碎球」卡尔霍恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's wrecking ball Calhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁克林野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brooklyn beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都…残了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all…broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是加纳·劳里斯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar freakin' Lawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太迷弟了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groupie much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该去打招呼吗 我该去打招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I go say hi? I should go say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去打招呼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很难过 保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard. All right, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, s-sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你站在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, saw you… saw you standing over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟我弟弟说我该过来打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and told my brother that I-I should come over and say hi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I came over and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳·劳里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar Lawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I-I got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候非常崇拜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}worshiped you, growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 这手我还要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. I plan on keeping that hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…10岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was… when I was 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次擅闯民宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my first b&e.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为想借别人家的付费电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}from borrowing some family's pay-per-view.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你和力量之塔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I could watch the cage match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁笼擂台赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and the Tower Of Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how I feel about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,害你年少时犯罪作何感想\N{\fnArial\fs30}contributing to your juvenile delinquency,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but appreciate it all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 对了 当年该你获胜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh… You were robbed, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet your ass I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是莉奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前是「超级炸弹」桑切斯的经纪人 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you used to manage superbomb Sanchez, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, b-but you… you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,场合不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你是我…第一个暗恋对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just y-you were my… my first crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的海报挂在床头的男人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had my poster above his bed, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还做经纪人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still managing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偶尔会主持比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call some matches sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大部分时候都在幕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm mostly behind the curtain, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,预订比赛 照顾拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}booking the shows and taking care of the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 有人去世一定很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Must be hard to see one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起做巡回很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spent a lot of time on the road together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like family,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近 我有太多的家人入土了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lately, I've seen too many of my boys be put in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟绞刑人认识25年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew hangman for 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:08:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信他会这么对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe he would do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.15,0:09:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 讣告里没写啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. That wasn't in the obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的家人不想广而告之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the family didn't want that advertised,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}so…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 我失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of which, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, word is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 他们今晚打算举办纪念赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know they're having a memorial show tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你急着回去 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you're itching to get back, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正明天世界还是那么一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}World's still gonna be screwed tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布鲁克林野兽回归对阵拉什 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Brooklyn beast returns against Rush - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 展开史诗般的铁人大战 - 好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in an epic iron man matchup! - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me hear you make some noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我印象中最强赛要更…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I remember the Top Notch shows being…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:09:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛大 是最强的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}grander, you know? Top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 如果你多喝点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, you drink enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有种回到过去的感觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个混蛋 - 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You dog. - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我们在守灵上认识的 她很和气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we met at the wake. She's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小时候不是还在床头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell you used to have a poster of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂过她的海报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}over your bed when you were a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得了 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,守灵时有个人告诉我他们今晚才能挣25美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy at the wake told me they're only making 25 bucks tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么点 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哪值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that hardly seems worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个个小镇地打 为了一点零花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Town after town, putting your ass on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}for next to nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有钱 没有荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No money. No glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你刚刚描述了我们的工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize you just literally described our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这肯定精彩 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is gonna be great. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的精彩谁会不喜欢 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to love some rasslin', am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒便宜 孩子也高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer's cheap, kid's entertained…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是做爹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}parenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 别跟妈妈说哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, don't tell mom how many I've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:11:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这让我回到过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Now, that brings me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别毁掉老爸为我们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to not try and ruin one of the nicest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最棒的一件事 - 女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- dad ever did for us, please? - Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请为地狱剃刀鼓掌 - 好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …Put your hands together for hellrazor! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要上场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a little something for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请为加纳·劳里斯鼓掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands together for Gunnar Lawless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:11:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?! Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get up. Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要 谁要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's getting it? Who's getting it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 他摘下手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember this? This is where he takes a glove off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在赛前送给个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gives it to some kid before the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我又不是小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一脚对脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big foot to the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳里斯踩上绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawless up on the ropes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的 加纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it, Gunnar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:12:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结他 了结他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and over! Up and over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,1 2 3\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 2, 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去撒个尿 乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to drain the dragon. Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束喽 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all over now, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}All right, you guys are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 别太难过了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, try to keep your head up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - What'd they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体 被刻了标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body…was marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟剪刀手爱德华玩挠痒痒来着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he get in a tickle fight with Edward Scissorhands?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 伤痕看上去是故意弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. T-the cuts look deliberate, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像仪式 - 怎么 你觉得是有案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ritualistic. - What, you think this is a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. A-a witch, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我回旅馆查查这个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'll head back to the motel, look into the symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下 到处问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here, shake some trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局 有些问题要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI. I got some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bueller?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. A-are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局 鲁西莫夫探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent, uh, Roussimoff, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也去了守灵 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you were at the wake, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 然后死了人 就又得开始上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and then the body dropped, and back on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识死者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know the deceased?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他卖过票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I-I sold him some tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个孩子 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我的人是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe my boys are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们真的被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we really are cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们巡回第一站 什里夫波特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in Shreveport, our first stop on the tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:17:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个维护人员在海外退伍军人协会后的垃圾箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}a maintenance guy foy d a body stashed in a dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind the VFW,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我一张你们人员的完整名单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I get a list of your whole crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔跤手 助理 所有随行人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrestlers, roadies, anybody that you roll with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,布置租赁赛场都是用当地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use locals for all the setups and concessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能带着拳手上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only afford to travel my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where would they be right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的酒吧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the nearest bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我是要去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that's where I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以 你还有朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can. You still have friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人希望你回来 希望路西法滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who want you back… who want Lucifer gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他把你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he's done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想象 但你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine, but you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是奴隶 或是狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a slave, a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼应该怕你才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the devil should be afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛看得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoy the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The show was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. You were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛之后的事就不太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the show, not so much, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是为此而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, kind of why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不早说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of buried the lead on that one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但听说最强比赛出这种事不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I hear this isn't the first murder at a Top Notch show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,场上场下 都是群不好惹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rough crowd… inside the ring and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,92年\N{\fnArial\fs30}'92.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开赛场后 几个无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving the ring and some damn reprobate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着破碎的酒瓶来打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes at me with a broken beer bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个犯人袭击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a, uh, perp got the drop on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定带走一小块腿留念\N{\fnArial\fs30}decided to take a chunk of my leg as a keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几根手指能屈能伸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far as I can bend these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还多亏了四百磅的约拿·兰西德\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to good ol' Jonah Rancid and all 400 pounds of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下压在了我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}just dropping down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:19:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还在比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yet you're still out there, still doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挨过打 被人吐过口水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been beat up, spit on,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捅伤过 挨过揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}stabbed, roughed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.78,0:20:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我绝对总要再站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I will be damned if I didn't always get back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的一个道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I learned…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不管遭遇什么 你都得继续撑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to keep on grinding no matter what's thrown your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我几个前妻说去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that to my ex-wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查到什么了 - 不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what do you got? - A lot, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强巡回每一站\N{\fnArial\fs30}So every stop on the Top Notch tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody turned up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不都是在场馆发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't all happen at the venue,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且大部分看上去像意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and most of them look like accidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们都有那个符号 包括绞刑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they all had the symbol… hangman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是自杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought he killed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 莉奥是那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what Rio said,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但警方没有结案\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the cops are treating it like an open case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为 原话是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're thinking, and I quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是奇怪的撒旦崇拜的玩意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's some kind of weird satanic crap."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:20:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还有更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个符号 是古苏美尔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}That symbol… ancient Sumerian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说有「汲取生命之火」的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said to have the power to "Pluck the spark of life."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Souls, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是恶魔喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're talking demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉奥说他们雇本地人布置场馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Rio says that they use locals to set up, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.43,0:21:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就是其中一个摔跤手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's got to be one of the wrestlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 赶紧过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,悠着点 你已经喝不少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy. I think you've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在沃斯堡市那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you helped me in Fort Worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道是你不让我上场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't know you got me kicked off the card?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不肯去快餐店帮忙 这我没法忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't job to Crazy D., and I couldn't abide by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.73,0:21:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你是受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you just can't stand the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我抢风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}of me stealing your thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 这我完全不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, I got no worries about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊 老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.83,0:22:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你得嗑点特效药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you need your go-juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.97,0:22:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他和他的毒贩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him and his dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.83,0:22:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的金童是个嗑药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your golden boy's a freaking junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你妈的 - 好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like hell. - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 还有两天才到孟菲斯市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harley, we got two days till memphis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把酒劲睡醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳 这事咱明天再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar, I'll talk to you about this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.05,0:22:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被下手更狠 身体更壮的汉子打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hit harder by guys a lot tougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不还手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, uh … why didn't you fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 老大 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, boss? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是寻常的一天 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:22:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 敬你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey. Here's, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能大人大量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to being the bigger man, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱还得多喝几杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.35,0:23:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh I wasn't …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:23:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.79,0:24:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.92,0:24:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly tequila…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.64,0:24:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,掺了点圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut with holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.23,0:24:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请所有摔跤手都喝了酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought drinks for all the wrestlers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.45,0:24:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 他们就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, you know, they're like,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你也得喝啊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well, you got to drink, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 他们太能喝了 尤其是莉奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, they can drink, especially Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仿佛都听到我的肝在咆哮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I heard my liver screaming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 有人有反应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did anyone react?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.12,0:24:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他们每个人都喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, except, uh, Harley,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.97,0:24:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个终极混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ultimate douchebag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没靠近他就先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bailed before I could get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里怎么这么亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it so bright in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.87,0:24:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.16,0:24:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.93,0:24:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.22,0:25:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.25,0:25:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.89,0:25:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这顺耳多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.26,0:25:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去找我藏的王牌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's go find the ace up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.98,0:26:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check this out. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有发现了 - 对 监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got something? - Yeah, uh, security-cam footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.58,0:26:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看看有没有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see if we got anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.11,0:26:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是半夜1：07 哈利往他房间去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so this is 1:07 A.M. Harley heads to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是… - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's… - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.55,0:26:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但进去了几分钟 那是哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, in there for a few minutes, and that's harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.80,0:26:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他被弄晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.05,0:26:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.44,0:26:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawless?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.23,0:26:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果哈利是恶魔 加纳是怎么放倒他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Harley is a demon, then how did Gunnar get the drop on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.36,0:26:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去找他问问就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find him and ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.62,0:26:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.11,0:27:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.89,0:27:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我之前很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I've been a dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前攻击了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a shot at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.20,0:27:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很过分 很…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a cheap shot. It was …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很下作\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a cheap-ass shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.21,0:27:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.66,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.53,0:27:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.50,0:27:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这由不得我决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.17,0:27:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Shawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的新死党\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.09,0:27:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通监控显示那辆卡车沿着威尔逊街北行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, traffic cameras show the truck heading north on Wilson,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.37,0:27:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了第一个和第二个监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}past first and second,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没出现在第三个上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it never got to third.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.91,0:27:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. That's … that's by the …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.89,0:27:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.24,0:28:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want my what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.84,0:28:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我想要什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.45,0:28:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,金钱 美女 荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money? Women? Glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.89,0:28:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪闪发光的金腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big, shiny belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.46,0:28:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来 就是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the word, and it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.96,0:28:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是个恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.83,0:28:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意人罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 这到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what the hell is …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.45,0:28:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on me, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.01,0:28:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不用住破烂的小旅馆 去偏僻的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more crappy motels, podunk towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.83,0:28:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将过上你一直渴望的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have the life you always wanted …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.02,0:28:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不尽的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}gumdrops and g-strings as far as the eye can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只想要一样东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I ask in return is …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.15,0:28:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.89,0:28:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能偶尔会让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I might occasionally ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一点点小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do me a teeny, tiny, little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.23,0:28:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kill-somebody kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.85,0:28:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.23,0:28:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:29:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你鲁莽 有野心 还很饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're brash and driven and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找新的经销商\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for new franchisees.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.17,0:29:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多一个是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have one when I can have two?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.22,0:29:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳就是位心满意足的顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar's what I like to call a satisfied customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.18,0:29:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.25,0:29:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.19,0:29:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.39,0:29:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不怎么相信上帝什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been much for god or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.17,0:29:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直觉得人大限一到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sort of just thought that when your curtain came down,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.39,0:29:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.49,0:29:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如你是个恶魔 那就意味着有地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're a demon, that means there's a hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有地狱 那就也有天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there's a hell, there is a heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.33,0:29:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为了一条我可以自己赢取的腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not giving up my shot at paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而放弃上天堂的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a belt I can win on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.59,0:29:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.15,0:30:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有天赋 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talented, Shawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人类的躯体 真是太脆弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the human body, it's just so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次受伤 走错一步…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One injury, one wrong step…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.98,0:30:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 如果有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, say, if somebody…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,割断了你的跟腱\N{\fnArial\fs30}severed your achilles tendon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.15,0:30:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.43,0:30:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜克 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duke, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.19,0:30:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.17,0:30:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.39,0:30:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的私人仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}My personal lockup …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念品 回忆物\N{\fnArial\fs30}keepsakes, mementos,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.85,0:31:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些我不希望被那群乌合之众拿到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}things I'd prefer the rabble not to get their grubby hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.48,0:31:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.06,0:31:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好的过去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.79,0:31:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.93,0:31:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.90,0:31:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rod of Aaron …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝在第六天创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Created by God on the sixth day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.96,0:31:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了亚伦 摩西的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and given to Aaron, brother of Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.13,0:31:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它很神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.56,0:31:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道它还是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had no idea that it was a…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.17,0:31:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hand of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.37,0:31:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以碰它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 西蒙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Simmons,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.98,0:31:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你驾驭不了我的棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you can handle my rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.20,0:31:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.00,0:31:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.47,0:31:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚说到了生殖器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it getting a little phallic in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this a fun surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得你可以背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really thought you could double-cross me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.51,0:32:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.46,0:32:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个词可是我发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I invented the double-cross?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, literally?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.72,0:32:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 如果没有可爱 聪敏的西蒙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I couldn't have orchestrated all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.23,0:33:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the lovely,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排好这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}talented Simmons here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.46,0:33:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提 她恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, um … she hates you, B-T-dubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.26,0:33:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.45,0:33:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱里每个恶魔都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, every demon in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.47,0:33:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪不得他们 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't really blame them, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.63,0:33:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.82,0:33:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经是史上最邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you were the evilest evil that ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.84,0:33:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶者 包括我在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}eviled … present company excluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.21,0:33:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就只是迪恩·温彻斯特的头号迷弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but Dean winchester's number-one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.03,0:33:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.32,0:33:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认 听过那么多故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to admit … after all the stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.65,0:33:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还对你们有些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.14,0:33:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.63,0:33:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你失望真是抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sorry to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.73,0:33:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错 不该抱太大期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault. You get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要10分的洛杉矶美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want an L.A. 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.34,0:33:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却安于堪萨斯的5分女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you settle for a Kansas 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:33:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.23,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫 - 我们不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The name's… - We don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 闲聊结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Small talk over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.64,0:34:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,加纳 加纳 别 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnar, Gunnar, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.53,0:34:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.64,0:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你藏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.99,0:34:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你眼里看见了最后一丝抵抗的光芒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see that last spark of defiance in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.68,0:34:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有酷刑逼供\N{\fnArial\fs30}And rather than beating it out of you, which …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.24,0:34:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然可行 但太麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}doable, but messy …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.22,0:34:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你领我到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let you lead me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.89,0:34:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带走这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna take this…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.52,0:34:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再收拾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then I'm gonna take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, oh, puppy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.15,0:35:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢接下来要发生的事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not gonna like what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.45,0:35:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得你可以背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you could double-cross me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.83,0:35:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.76,0:35:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完善了这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I perfected the double-cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.25,0:35:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.31,0:36:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是身为上帝的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is what it feels like to be God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.86,0:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.85,0:36:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.35,0:36:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if this can hurt something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.03,0:36:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能伤害黑暗那样强大的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}as powerful as the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.43,0:36:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你使用又会怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder… what can it do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.57,0:36:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 孩子 我并不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kid. I don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.61,0:36:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like I got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.43,0:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那人 他是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy out there, he's a …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.41,0:36:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个恶魔 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a demon. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.01,0:36:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道地狱和交易什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know about hell and deals … all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.73,0:36:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有你什么把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he got over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.02,0:36:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卖了自己的灵魂 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your soul, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.34,0:37:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,10年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.07,0:37:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再争取一次腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted another shot at that belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.63,0:37:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万人 尖叫我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 000 people screaming my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.02,0:37:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时不顾一切 犯了傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was desperate and dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.53,0:37:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你只当了一周冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you only had the title for like a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.42,0:37:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说不顾一切 犯了傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate and dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.49,0:37:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.22,0:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞砸了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you screwed up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.15,0:37:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.35,0:37:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但做对的事 永远为时不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is never too late to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.81,0:37:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me bleed my own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.75,0:38:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法力了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of juice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.62,0:38:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.25,0:38:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力知道你这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Crowley know you're doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.37,0:38:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力是路西法的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's Lucifer's bitch boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.20,0:38:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.27,0:38:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.81,0:38:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,存点储备金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Building a nest egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.46,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗在外 魔鬼掌管地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the Darkness out and the devil running hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.64,0:38:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在每个恶魔都得为自己打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, it's kind of every demon for him/her/shimself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.03,0:38:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么需要劳里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why do you need Lawless?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:39:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能身处多处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't be everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易到期时 我便让他选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the G-man's deal came due, I gave him a choice …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.32,0:39:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么喂地狱之犬 要么为我收集灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}end up hellhound chow or collect souls for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.11,0:39:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我委派他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm delegating.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.09,0:39:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的管理者就这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what good managers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yourself, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最喜欢的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this … this is my favorite part.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.05,0:39:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Hey. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.89,0:39:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.58,0:39:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直好奇它们叫起来什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wondered what they'd sound like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:39:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.01,0:40:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.53,0:40:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.30,0:40:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.06,0:40:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我憎恨镜子里看着我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I hate the face looking back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.82,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.79,0:40:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.01,0:40:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.07,0:40:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.10,0:40:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳里斯是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawless was a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.41,0:41:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不该那样惨死 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't deserve to go out like that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.40,0:41:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他做了错误的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know what? He made a bad decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.13,0:41:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.12,0:41:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.93,0:41:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你 我 现在是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you, me, now Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们会救回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we'll get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.84,0:41:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的 我们只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will. We just got to …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.60,0:41:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续撑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep grinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.05,0:41:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有多痛 不管有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how much it hurts, no matter how hard it gets,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.04,0:41:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要继续撑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to keep grinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.09,0:41:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.68,0:41:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要这样赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.50,0:41:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.73,0:41:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会救回小卡 我们会杀了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna save Cass, we're gonna ice the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.53,0:41:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会干掉黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna shank the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.74,0:41:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyone that gets in our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.76,0:41:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁就别想活\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, god help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.86,0:41:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.63,0:41:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
